 *   - zainduo-technical-specs.jpg            (landscape, 1376×768)
 *   - zainduo-applications-dramatic.jpg      (landscape, 1376×768)
 *   - zainduo-dubai-marina-highrise.jpg      (landscape, 1376×768)
 * TODO: convert to optimised WebP to match the zainsquare asset pipeline.
 * og:image falls back to the hero file (no purpose-built 1200×630 card yet).
 *
 * ─── DECISIONS TAKEN ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 *   - Hero "Request Free Sample" CTA scrolls to the in-page lead-capture form
 *     (id="lead-form", Section 10) — a Netlify Forms POST, matching the
 *     zero-JS pattern in src/pages/contact.astro. The secondary button there
 *     opens WhatsApp.
 *   - Structured data: a single combined @graph (BreadcrumbList + Product +
 *     FAQPage) is emitted inline per the build request. The visible breadcrumb
 *     trail is hand-rolled here (not the <Breadcrumbs /> component) so the
 *     BreadcrumbList is declared exactly once. Organization JSON-LD is still
 *     emitted sitewide by BaseLayout.
 *   - Canonical host: the request shows "rukanalzain.com"; the configured site
 *     is "ruknalzain.ae" (astro.config.mjs) — canonical is built from that
 *     via the BaseLayout `canonical` prop (same choice as the zainsquare
 *     sibling).
 */
